<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MIC" style="id">Mikah</book>
  <para style="h">Mikah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mikah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mikah</para>
  <para style="mt">Mikah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah kumpipa Jotham, Ahaz, leh Hezekiah vaihawm laia Moreseth mi Mikah kiang a Toupa thu hongtung, Samaria khua leh Jerusalem khaw tungtang thu a muh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nou, mite aw, na vek un za unla: Aw lei leh asung a om tengteng aw, ngaikhia un: Toupa Pathian, Toupa a biakin siangthou a kipan, nou dem in na tungthu uh theihpihpa hi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai dih ua, Toupa a mun a kipan in a hongpawt a, a hong paisuk ding a, lei munsangte a chil ngal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mei kiang chin a khuainun bang leh mun ken a tui kikhoh khia bang mai in, tangte a nuai ah a zul ding a, munzangte a khangkham ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hiai tengteng Jakobte tatlekna ziak leh Israel inkawte khelhna ziak ahi. Jakobte tatlekna bang ahia oi? Samaria ahi kei maw? Judah mun sangte bang ahia? Jerusalem ahi kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in Samaria gam a thilsia omkhawm bang in ka bawl ding a, grephuan mun bang mai in: huai mun a suangte luiguam ah ka khukkhe ding a, a suangphumte ka dawksak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A milim bawltawm tengteng sukkhap vek ahi ding a, a kizuakna mante mei a haltum ahi ding a, a milim tengteng ka hihgawp ding: kizuakna man ding in a la vek ngal a, kizuakna man mah in a pang nawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiaiziakin ka kap ding a, ka mau vongvong ding a, kisuah leh vuaktang in ka om ding: sehalte bang in ka kikou ding a, vangawngsaute bang in ka thum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A liamna hihdam theih ahi kei: Judah gam a tungta ngal a: ka mite kongpi, Jerusalem hial a tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gath khua ah genkei unla kap hetkei un; Beth-leaphra khua ah leivui lak ah ki khuk un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Saphir mi, vuaktang leh zumtakin paimang in: Zaanan mite Beth-ezel kahna ziak in hong pawtkhe kei ding ua; huai ah bitna mun a omlouh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maroth mi in tanhoih tan a ngaklah tuntun hi, Toupa kiang a kipan thil hoihlou Jerusalem kongpi tan a a hongtun suk ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Lakis mi, kangtalai sakol hattak henden in: amah pen Zion tanu khelhna kipatna ahi. Israelte tatlekna nang a muh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huaiziak in Moreseth-gath kiang ah kikhakna thilpiak na piak ding ahi: Akzib innte Israel gam kumpipate adin khemna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Maresa mi, nang hon zoutu na kiang ah konpi ding: Israelte thupina Adullam pha in a hongpai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kimet giau inla, na ta deihtakte ziak in kimet giau in: musane bang in kihih giau semsem in; na kiang a kipan a sal a pi in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A lupna tung ua thulimlouhna gelmi leh thil hoihlou ngaihtuah khemi tung a gik hi: zingsang a khua a vak in huai a hihzel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi loute eng in a laksak ua; innte a eng ua, a laksak zel uhi: mi leh a inkawte uh mi leh a goutan un a nuaisiah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n hichi in a chi: “Ngai dih, hiai inkaw tung ah thil hoihlou ka gel ahi, huai a kipan in na ngawng uh na suan kei ding ua, kisathei tak in a pai nawn kei ding uh; hun hoihlou a hih ding ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in nou dem in gentehna a bawl ding ua, kahla khasiathuai a sam in: "Loh in i om vekta ua, ka mite thiltan a kilamdangta; ei kipan gam lakmang ahi a; helhatmi kiang ah i lou uh hawmzak ahita," a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa mite kikhawmte lak ah aisan a khau a tehsakmi kuamah na neikei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thu genkei un, chi in a genzel ua, hiai mite kiang ah thu a genkei ding uh: gensiatna a dai kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Jakob inkawte aw, Toupa kha nehden in a om ahia? Hiaite a thilhih chih ding ahi maw? Diktak a om zel mi tung ah ka thute’n thil hoih a hih kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh ka mite tunai chin in melma bang in a hong dingkhia uhi: kidou utlou a galmuangtak a mi vialvakte lak a kipan in a puansilh puanaktualte uh na suah sak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka mi numeite a inn nuamtak ua kipan na delhkhia ua; a naupang noute a kipan ka thupina a lamang den uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thou unla, paimang un; hiai khawlna mun ding ahi kei a; siatna thupitak tan ahi a, buahna a om ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi kuahiam in kha a om chi in zuauthu gen in, “Uain leh zu na taina ding uh ahi” chi in hong gen leh huai mi mipite kituahpih lel zawlnei ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Jakobte, na vek un k’on samkhawm ding a; Israel omsunte ka pikhawm ding a; Bozrah khua belam bang a koihkhawm ding: ganhon a loupa mun ua om bang in, mipi a hih ziak un a chiak zuazua ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ma uah lampi phuvangpa a pai a; a phu pailet ua, kongkhak pha in a pai zel ua, huai ah a paikhia uhi: a kumpipa uh a ma uah a pai a, Toupa’n a ma uh a kai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw nou Jakob heutute leh Israel inkaw vaihawmmite aw, Ngaikhia unla, k’on ngen hi ka chi ahi: vaihawm dan na theih ding uh hilou hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil hoih na hua ua, thil hoihlou na it ua, a vun uh na hawksak ua, a guh ua kipan in sa na leukhia uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka mite sa ne in; a vun uh na lip ua, a guh uh na hihtansak ua: ahi, sa uina bel sung a sa atnen bang in huan ding in na at nen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in Toupa a sam ding ua, himahleh amau a dawng kei ding: ahi, huai hun chiang in a thilhih ua a hih hoihlouh dan bang un, amau a kipan a mai a sel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka mite thil hihkhial sakmi, nekding banghiam piak a a om chiang ua Muanna chi a kikou a, huaibang peloute peuhmah kidouna thu a vau lau zawlneite tungtang thu Toupa’n hichi in a chi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in kilakna na neihlouhna ding un noute kiang zan hongtung hi; ai na san theihlouhna ding un na kiang uah mialna a hongom ding a; Zawlneite ading in ni a tum ding a, sun amau tung ah mial ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mutheimite a zum ding ua, aisansiamte a zahlak ding uh, avek un muk a hum ding uh: Pathian in a dawn louh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh Jakobte kiang ah a tatlekna uh theisak ding leh Israelte kiang ah a khelhna uh theisak ding in Toupa kha ziak a thilhihtheihnate, vaihawmnate, hatnate in ka dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nou Jakob inkawte heutute leh Israel inkaw vaihawmmi, vaihawmna kih a, dikna chiteng lumlet mite aw, hiai ngaikhia un, k’on ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zion sisan in a lam ua, Jerusalem ginatlouhna in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai ah heutute’n kipahman lamen in vai a hawm ua, siampute’n loh lamen in a sinsak ua, a zawlneite’n dangka lamen in ai a san uhi: huchi in leng, Toupa a lak uah a om ka hia? Thil hoihlou i tung uah a hong tungkei ding, chi in Toupa tung ah a kinga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huaiziak in Zion, noute ziak in, lou bang a leileh ahi ding a, Jerusalem thilsia omkhawm ahi ding a, biakin omna gammang bang ahi ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Himahleh ni nanung chiang in hichi ahi ding a, Toupa inn omna tang, tanglian tungte a hihkip in a om ding a, tang neute tung ah tawisang in a om ding; huai ah tawisang in a om ding; huai ah chichihte a pai zungzung ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nam tampite a pai ding ua, hong unla, Toupa tang ah, Jakob Pathian inn ah i hohtou ding uh; huchi in aman a lampi tanchinte hon sinsak ding a, a lampite ah i pai ding ua, a chi ding uh; Zion a pan danthu a hongpawt ding a. Toupa thu bel Jerusalem a kipan in a hongpawt ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman chi tampi lak ah vai a hawm dia, gamlapi a nam hattak leng a sal ding; A namsaute uh leilehna muk zum din a sek ding ua, a teipite uh theikung attanna temkawi ding in a sek ding uh; namdang in namdang tung ah namsau a likta kei ding a, kidou dan leng a sinsakta kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi chihte a grepgui nuai uah leh a theipi kung nuai uah a tu ding ua; kuamah in a lausak kei ding ua, sepaihte Toupa kam in a genta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chichih amau pathian min chiat in a om ding ua, ei leng Toupa i Pathian min in tangtawn tangtawn in i om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n hichi in a chi: Huai ni chiang in khebaite ka kaikhawm ding a, delhmang a om leh sukgim a omte ka kaikhawm ding hi chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A damsunte ka khosuaksak ding a, gamlapi a delhmang a omte bel nam hattak in ka bawl ding: tuban siah Zion tang ah tangtawn in Toupa’n a tung uah vai a hawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw nang, ganchinna insang, Zion tanu tenna bitna tang, na kiang ah lalgam masa a hongtung ding; ahi, Jerusalem tanu kiang ngei ah lalgam a hongtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bang a chia hichi nak kah na hia? Na sung ah kumpipa a om ka hia, nang hon gensakpa a mangthangta ahia, numei nauvei bang a lunggimna in nang a hon mat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Zion tanu, numei nauvei suak ding bang in natna thuak in vei in: khopi a kipan in na pawtkhe ding a, gam ah na teng ding a, Babulon tanpha a paiding na hi ngal a, huai ah hotkhiak in na om ding a, huai ah na melmate khut a kipan Toupa’n nang a hon honkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin tampi nang hondou in a kikhawm ua, hihbuai in om henla, i mit in Zion tung a a lunggulh pen mu hen, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa ngaihtuahnate a theikei ua, a phatsakna leng a theisiam sam kei uh: phual a buhphal koihkhawm bang in amau a kaikhawmta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Zion tanu, thou inla chil in: na ki sik bang in ka bawl ding a, na khepek dal bang in ka bawl ding; huan mi tampite na satnen ding a: a thilneihte uh Toupa adia na koihtuam ding ahi, a sum uh lei kumpi Toupa adin a koihtuam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw sepaih honpi tanu, tuin sepaih hon kaikhawm inla: amau a hon umsuakta ua: Israelte vaihawmpa a biang ah sikchiang in a sun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Himahleh nang Bethlehem Ephratha, Judah gam a sang tampi lak a tel din neu tawk lechin leng, nang a kipan in Israelte vaihawmpa ding kei din a hongpawt ding; a hongpawtna sawtpi, tanglai nite a kipan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaiziak in nauveimi’n a suahsak ma teng amau a lehngatsan ding: huchi in a unau omsunte Israel suante kiang ah a kiknawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah ading dia, Toupa a Pathian min thupina ngei in: amau a omta ding ua: amah lah leitawp pha in a thupi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan, hiai mi kilemna ahi ding; Assuria mi a gam ua a hong a, i kumpipa uh innte a honsik chiang in, amah dou ding in belampu sagih leh mi thupi giat i kitelkhe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Assuria gam namsau in a hihse ding ua, Nimrod gam a lutna a hihse lai ding uh: huan aman, i gam ua Assuria mi hong a, i gam chiang uh a hongsik hun in, amah a kipan in a hon honkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jakob mi omsunte chi tampi lak ah Toupa a kipan a daitui kia bang leh loupa tung a vuahzu bang in a om ding uh; huai in mihing a ngak kei a, mihing tapate a ngak sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jakobte mi omsunte namte lak ah leh chi tampite lak ah gamnuai sate lak a humpinelkai bang leh belamhon lak a humpinelkai lunlai bang in a om ding: aman a paisuak peuhmahte a sikden a, a botnen a, humbit ding leng kuamah a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na khut nang hondoute tung ah lik in om henla, na melma tengteng hihman in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in hichi ahi ding a, Toupa’n a chi, nang a kipan in na sakolte ka hihmang ding a, na kangtalaite ka hihse ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na khopite ka hihmang ding a, na kulhhat tengteng ka hihchim ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na khut a kipan bumsiamte ka hihmang ding a; aisansiamte ka hihmang ding a; aisansiamte na nei nawnta kei ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang a kipan na milim bawltawmte leh na suangphuhte ka hihmang ding a; na khutsuakte na be nawn kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang a kipan Aserte ka botkhe ding a; na khopite ka hihse ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan thu ngaikhelou namte tung ah hehna leh thangpaihna in phulakna ka piching sak ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa thugen tuin ngaikhia un; Thou inla, tang liante ma ah lang in, tang neute’n na aw ngaikhia uhen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw tang liante aw, Toupa honhekna ngaikhia unla, nou leitung kingaknate aw, ngaikhia un: Toupa a mite toh a kilang a, Israelte a hekna gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw ka mite aw, na tung uah bang ka hihta a ahia? Banglam in ahia k’on hihgim? Hon gen dih ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta gam a kipan in nou k’on pikhia a, saltanna inn apan nou k’on tankhia a; na ma uah Mosi, Aron leh Miriam ka sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw ka mite aw, Toupa thilhih diktat na theihna ding un, Moab kumpipa Balak thusawm leh Boer tapa Balaam in a dawn dan, Sittim a kipan a Gilgal pha a thil omdan khong tuin theigige un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bang toh ahia Toupa ma a kongpai ding a, Pathian tungnung ma a ka kun ding? Haltum thillatte, bawngnou kum khat a upate toh A ma ah ka hongpai dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa belamtal sang tampi hiam sathau lui singte hiam ah a lungkim dia hia? Ka tatlekna ziak in ka tachil pia in, ka khelhna ziak in pumpigah ka pedia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw mihing, a hoih nang a hon ensakta hi; Toupa’n nang a honphut bang ahia? Diktak a hihleh hehpihna it leh na Pathian toh kiniamkhiak a tonkhawm ahi kei maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa’n khopi a sam hi, pilna nei mi’n na min laudan a siam ding: khetbuk leh a bawlmi limsak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Migilou inn sung ah gitlouhna a kaihkhawm goubawmte leh tehna diklou kihhuai tak a omlai hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bukna diklou zangte leh khemna dia gikdan tehna diklou zangte siangthou ka chi ding ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai a mi hausate lah hiamgamna in a dim ua, huai a tengte’n zuau a gen ua, a kam sung ua a lei uh khemhat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in ken leng nakpi a hon limsak in k’on khen a; na khelhna ziak in k’on hihgam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na ne ding a, himahleh na taikei ding; na kiang ah na daina a om ding a: na khol ding a, himahleh a bit kei ding; na kholsate namsau in a pai mangpih ding in ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na ching ding a, himahleh na lakei ding: Olive gahte na chil ding a, himahleh a thau na nilh kei ding; grep chil mah lechin, a uain na dawn kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Omri thusehte lah na vom gige ngal a, Ahab inkaw thuhilhna tengteng zui in amau lemtheihna ah na pai uhi; huchi in mun gam gawp in k’on bawl sinta hi, na sung a tengte simmawh thuak in soisak in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka tung gikna mai e: nipi thei a sekkhawm hunlai a om bang leh grep loh hunlai a grep maih lohding bang ka hi ngal a: gahbom nek ding a omkei; ka hinna in theipi min masa a lunggulh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian limsakmi lei a kipan a mang ua, mihing lak ah midiktak a omkei uh: sisan suah ding in a tang vek ua; michih in amau unau len in a gem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A khutte uh thil hoihlou tung a thanuamtak a hih ding in a nga ua; kumpipa’n thilpiak ngiat a, vaihawmpa’n a negu a; mi lian in a lungsim thil hihkhelhna a genkhia a: huai in a kithutuak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A lak ua mi hoihpen loulingnei bang ahi a; midik pen leng dailing nei sang in a hoihkei zaw: nang vengmite ni, veh a na om ni ngei a hongtung hi; huai bel a mangbat ni uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lawm ah muang kei unla, makaimi ah ginna koih kei un: na angsung a omnu a kipan in na kam kongkhakte veng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tapa in pa min a hihsia a, tanu in a nu a dou a, mou in a pi a dou ngal a; mihing melmate zaw amah inkawte mah ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ken zaw Toupa lam ka en ding a; ka hotdamna Pathian ka ngak ding; ka Pathian in a hon ngaikhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw ka melma, ka puk hun chiang in hon awi ken: ka thou nawn ding; mial a ka tut in leng Toupa kei din vak ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa tung a thil ka hih khelh ziak in, a lunghih louhna mahmah ka paw ding, ka tungthu a hon genpih a, kei adia vaihawmna a tangtun masiah; vak ah a hon pikhe ding a, huan diktatna ka mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in ka melma ka kiang a, Toupa na Pathian koi ah, chipa’n huai a mu ding a, zahlakna’n amah a tuam ding hi. Ka mite’n amah a en ding ua: tun zaw kongzing buannawi bang a sikden ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na kulh bangte bawlna ni ding leh na gamgi kekletna ni hongtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Assuria gam leh Aigupta khopi a kipan, Aigupta leh Lui phahial a kipan, tuipi leh tuipi kikal a kipan leh tang leh tang kikal a kipan na kiang ah a hongpai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi pi in gam, asung a tengte ziak leh a thilhih uh gah ziak in hihgam ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Karmel tangkal a gamnuai a lungzuang tak a om na goutan belamhon, na mite na khetbuk zang in vak inla: nidanglai bang in Bashan leh Gilead ah vak in om chiat uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aigupta gam a kipan a na paikhiaklai bang in a kiang ah thillamdang mahmahte ka ensak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Namchih in huai a mu ding ua, a thilhihtheihna tengteng uh a zumpih ding uh: a muk uh a hum ding ua, a beng uh a ngong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gul bang in leivui a liak ding ua; khupboh a vakte bang in a omna kua ua kipan in ling kawm in a hongpai ding uh: Toupa i Pathian kiang ah laudansiam kawm in a hongpai ding ua, nang ziak in a lau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang bang a thulimlouhna ngaidampa leh a goutan omsun tatlekna nelhsiah Pathian kua a om a? A hehna tangtawn in a vom gige kei, hehpihna a a kipah mahmah ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A kihei kiknawn ding a, i tung ah hehpihna a nei ding; i thulimlouhnate a khe nuai ah a sikden ding; nang amau khelhna tengteng tuipi taw thukpi ah na pailut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nidanglai a ka pu leh pate kiang a na kichiamsa, Jakob kiang a thutak leh Abraham kiang a hehpihna na tangtun ding hi.
  </para>
</usx>
